    "CommitMsg": "phase 5: containers verified, Firefox and parallel E2E in Docker, hardened images; phase 6 scans started\n\n- clean install 27 s with smoke test (PORT-01); E2E chromium/firefox/mobile, 4 workers, 20 passed in Docker\n- ENV-01 confirmed (Docker Desktop port forwarding), ENV-02 bypassed (Firefox in the Playwright image)\n- images: Alpine bases, nginx 1.31.7, apk upgrade, pip removed from runtime: Trivy 0 vulnerabilities on both\n- SAST (Bandit 0, gitleaks 0, Semgrep 19/20 fixed), SCA (pip-audit 0/31, npm 0, SBOMs), SEC-01..SEC-04 tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
